Export the corecrypto ChaCha20 functions CommonCrypto imports.

libcommonCrypto.dylib imports ccchacha20 and ccchacha20poly1305_{info,
encrypt_oneshot,decrypt_oneshot} from libcorecrypto.dylib (lib/CommonCryptorChaCha20*.c),
but corecrypto's scripts/exported-symbols.exp had the whole chacha family commented
out: the functions are compiled (src/ccchacha20poly1305.c) but not exported. dyld's
shared-cache builder binds eagerly and rejected the cache on the dangling import (the
runtime loader tolerated it lazily, since bash never calls ChaCha20). Uncomment exactly
the four functions corecrypto defines and CommonCrypto imports.

Signed-off-by: Niclas Overby <niclas@overby.me>
---
--- a/scripts/exported-symbols.exp
+++ b/scripts/exported-symbols.exp
@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@
 _cccast_ecb_encrypt_mode
 _cccast_ofb_crypt_mode
 #_cccbc_one_shot
-#_ccchacha20
+_ccchacha20
 #_ccchacha20_final
 #_ccchacha20_init
 #_ccchacha20_reset
@@ -72,12 +72,12 @@
 #_ccchacha20_update
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_aad
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_decrypt
-#_ccchacha20poly1305_decrypt_oneshot
+_ccchacha20poly1305_decrypt_oneshot
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_encrypt
-#_ccchacha20poly1305_encrypt_oneshot
+_ccchacha20poly1305_encrypt_oneshot
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_finalize
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_incnonce
-#_ccchacha20poly1305_info
+_ccchacha20poly1305_info
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_init
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_reset
 #_ccchacha20poly1305_setnonce
